Specification Leap Year

Attributes LeapYearCases
| Name   | DataType |
| Year   | Integer  |
| Result | YesNo    |
| Notes  | String   |

Calculation Determine Whether A Year Is A Leap Year
Description A leap year is divisible by 4, except century years which must be divisible by 400.
Examples: LeapYearCases
| Year | Result | Notes                                  |
| 2001 | No     | Not divisible by 4.                    |
| 2002 | No     | Not divisible by 4.                    |
| 2003 | No     | Not divisible by 4.                    |
| 1996 | Yes    | Divisible by 4 and not a century year. |
| 2004 | Yes    | Divisible by 4 and not a century year. |
| 2024 | Yes    | Divisible by 4 and not a century year. |
| 1700 | No     | Divisible by 100 but not by 400.       |
| 1800 | No     | Divisible by 100 but not by 400.       |
| 1900 | No     | Divisible by 100 but not by 400.       |
| 2000 | Yes    | Divisible by 400.                      |
| 2400 | Yes    | Divisible by 400.                      |
| 1999 | No     | Not divisible by 4.                    |
| 2100 | No     | Divisible by 100 but not by 400.       |